"""
## Purpose and audience
Executable specification for Wave F4: 3-way PERF-* cost-tier isolation (`D12`,
`I10`), canonical Safe Edit Service (`perf_safe_edit_service_v1`, section 10,
`I01`, `I02`, `I05`, `I07`), and Lint Profiles / CLI surface (`perf-fast`,
`perf`, `perf-deep`, `--changed`, `--format json`, `--explain`, `--fix-safe`,
section 11.3).
Audience: compiler, diagnostics, lint, and refactoring maintainers.
"""
# @cover src/compiler/90.tools/lint/_LintMain/config_and_model.spl
# @cover src/compiler/90.tools/lint/_LintMain/rule_cost_tier.spl
# @cover src/compiler/90.tools/lint/rules/perf_analysis_rule.spl
# @cover src/compiler/90.tools/fix/perf_safe_edit_service_v1.spl
# @cover src/app/io/cli_lint_commands.spl
# @req REQ-DIAG-POLICY-001
# @req REQ-DIAG-011

